WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.971 --> 00:00:15.265
Thailand Highway 3259

00:00:16.766 --> 00:00:20.812
is a sugarcane transport road.

00:00:24.816 --> 00:00:26.109
Thousands of farmers

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:30.613
use it to get their crops to the refinery.

00:00:45.795 --> 00:00:47.422
But this highway

00:00:47.422 --> 00:00:51.468
has a toll collector.

00:00:59.768 --> 00:01:04.314
Locals call him the Don.

00:01:06.941 --> 00:01:11.821
And this is his territory.

00:01:12.822 --> 00:01:15.533
He's a master dealmaker,

00:01:15.533 --> 00:01:18.161
calculating risk versus reward

00:01:19.954 --> 00:01:24.959
to get what he's due.

00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:33.885
The Don can actually sniff out

00:01:34.177 --> 00:01:38.932
when a delivery truck is on the way.

00:01:45.021 --> 00:01:47.065
He can gauge quantity

00:01:47.065 --> 00:01:51.194
using his sense of smell alone.

00:02:00.245 --> 00:02:01.663
Targeting the trucks

00:02:01.663 --> 00:02:05.583
carrying the biggest loads.

00:02:14.968 --> 00:02:16.386
Time to collect

00:02:16.386 --> 00:02:19.055
his toll.

00:02:38.449 --> 00:02:42.662
170 pounds of raw sugarcane

00:02:43.329 --> 00:02:46.082
provides the 70,000 calories

00:02:46.332 --> 00:02:50.461
he needs every day.

00:03:02.557 --> 00:03:04.184
But the Don

00:03:04.893 --> 00:03:07.896
is not on his own.

00:03:12.942 --> 00:03:16.446
He's brought some younger bulls along.

00:03:16.446 --> 00:03:17.697
Henchmen

00:03:18.573 --> 00:03:21.826
to show them how it's done.

00:03:39.886 --> 00:03:43.514
They watch the Don's technique,

00:03:44.057 --> 00:03:48.269
he knows that if they aren't too greedy,

00:03:48.269 --> 00:03:52.023
the drivers will pay his toll.

00:03:56.653 --> 00:03:58.696
And in return,

00:03:58.696 --> 00:04:02.325
he and his accomplices
will stay out of their sugar cane

00:04:02.325 --> 00:04:05.453
fields.

00:04:15.588 --> 00:04:20.051
Their observation
and knowledge of us has helped elephants

00:04:20.051 --> 00:04:23.513
to get by in an ever more human dominated

00:04:23.513 --> 00:04:27.267
landscape.

00:04:32.981 --> 00:04:35.358
But their long term future

00:04:35.358 --> 00:04:38.528
may depend on us understanding them

00:04:39.237 --> 00:04:43.741
as individuals.

